# Workshop — track the notebooks and the small model/scaler artifacts
# (these override the broad *.ipynb / *.json / *.joblib rules above).
# The large grace_workshop.parquet stays ignored (hosted on Google Drive).
!workshop/*.ipynb
!workshop/nb3_model_cyclic.json
!workshop/nb3_scaler_cyclic.joblib
